!!
!! These accelerators are for propagating events from the input-only
!! window that the background uses for receiving events to the background
!! ViewPanel wigdet.  These accelerators are not used by dirviews.
!!
FileManager*panel.accelerators: #override\
~s ~m ~a <Key>Return:Command()\n\
a <Key>Return:Command(Alt)\n\
<Key>osfActivate:Command()\n\
<Key>osfCancel:Deselect()\n\
:<Key>osfPageUp:PageUp()\n\
:<Key>osfPageDown:PageDown()\n\
:<Key>osfBeginLine:Top()\n\
:<Key>osfEndLine:Bottom()\n\
:<Key>osfUp:Up()\n\
:<Key>osfDown:Down()\n\
<Key>:TypeToSelect()\n\
s c <Btn1Motion>:BoxSelect() DragStart(Link)\n\
c ~s <Btn1Motion>:BoxSelect() DragStart(Copy)\n\
<Btn1Motion>:BoxSelect() DragStart(Move)\n\
s c <Btn2Down>:Select() Paste() DragStart(Link)\n\
c ~s <Btn2Down>:Select() Paste() DragStart(Copy)\n\
<Btn2Down>:Select() Paste() DragStart(Move)\n\
s ~c <Btn1Down>:ExtendSelect() Expand() BoxSelectArm() MouseClick() CheckForDoubleClick()\n\
a <Btn1Down>:Select() MouseClick() CheckForDoubleClick(Alt)\n\
<Btn1Down>:Select() CheckForDoubleClick() Expand() MouseClick() BoxSelectArm()\n\
<Btn1Up>:Rename() BoxSelectEnd() BoxSelectDisarm()\n\
<Btn2Up>:Rename()\n\
<Motion>:Motion()\n\
<EnterNotify>:EnterPanel()\n\
<LeaveNotify>:LeavePanel()

